---
// ==========================================================================
// Bo, traced in LAYERS from generated ink art (Higgsfield -> potrace).
//
// Layered on purpose: each layer carries its own night rule, and one
// flattened path cannot. The rule:
//
//   - the black body does NOT invert to white at night. It stays dark, lifted
//     just enough to separate from a black page, and gains a visible light
//     rim instead. Inverting a soot sprite turns the character into a hole.
//   - white fill stays white in both themes. Eye whites are white *because
//     eyes are white*, not because the paper is.
//
// Replaces a hand-traced silhouette whose linework read as coarse next to the
// generated sprite sheets it sits beside.
//
// No `flip` prop, deliberately: Bo is asymmetric and mirroring hands the
// bindle to the wrong arm. See public/parallax/README.md.
// ==========================================================================
interface Props {
	size?: number;
	class?: string;
}
const { size = 120, class: className = "" } = Astro.props;
---

